msgid ""
"`Zubax GNSS 2 <https://zubax.com/products/gnss_2>`__ is a high-performance "
"positioning module for outdoor environments with doubly redundant `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org>`__ bus interface. It includes a state-of-the-art "
"GPS/GLONASS receiver, a high-precision barometer and a 3-axis compass."
msgstr ""
"`Zubax GNSS 2 <https://zubax.com/products/gnss_2>`__ 是一款面向户外环境的高性能定位模块，具备双冗余"
" `DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org>`__ 总线接口，集成了顶级 GPS/GLONASS 接收机、高精度气压计和三轴罗盘。"

